    "body": "## Summary\r\n- Added a non-blocking banner to `ModernPOSActivity` prompting merchants to list their store on BTCMap.\r\n- Includes a secondary \"Learn more\" screen with an explainer, hero background image (zoomed and cropped), and a direct link to BTCMap's add location page using an embedded Chrome tab.\r\n- Added a \"Reset BTCMap Promotion\" option in Developer Settings for easier testing.\r\n\r\n## Key Changes\r\n- Created `layout_btcmap_banner.xml` for the promo banner.\r\n- Added `BtcMapExplainerActivity.kt` and `activity_btcmap_explainer.xml` for the explainer screen.\r\n- Updated `ModernPOSActivity.kt` to manage banner lifecycle, animation, and persistence using `PreferenceStore`.\r\n- Added reset logic to `DeveloperSettingsActivity.kt`.\r\n- Updated `AndroidManifest.xml` to include the new activity.",
